From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GloriousEggroll <gloriouseggroll@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:51:07 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] win32u, winex11: Draw the child windows of exclusive
 fullscreen GL windows scaled.

Star Wars Galactic Battlegrounds shows its name prompt as an edit control
over its 800x600 DirectDraw (wined3d GL) window. With the display mode
emulated, the edit control drew directly to the X window, unscaled, and the GL
drawable covering the whole window painted over it on the next frame.

Keep the scaled window surface of such windows while they show children, let
the children draw into it, and cut holes in the client window over them,
except while the Steam overlay is open. Flush the surface clipped by children
then, and fix its offset for surfaces with a border around scaled contents.
---
 dlls/win32u/dce.c            |  3 +-
 dlls/win32u/win32u_private.h |  1 +
 dlls/win32u/window.c         | 53 ++++++++++++++++++++++-
 dlls/winex11.drv/bitblt.c    | 26 +++++++++--
 dlls/winex11.drv/init.c      | 84 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 dlls/winex11.drv/x11drv.h    |  1 +
 6 files changed, 163 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

